  "body": "The official docker image matrixdotorg/synapse only works with x86_64. I successfully started the docker file on my aarch64 machine by simply changing the images from `docker.io/python` to `docker.io/arm64v8/python` in the Dockerfile.\r\n\r\nPlease provide this prebuilt as well :)",
